    "note": "Collection runs Monday to Saturday, national holidays included. There's no collection on Sundays or Jan 1–3, and on Dec 31 only burnable and non-burnable are collected. Burnable and non-burnable must be out by 8:00, 9:30 or 12:30 depending on your collection point, so check its sign. Plastic, recyclables and booked oversized items must be out by 8:00 on the day.",
